{"title":"Obituary: Professor Steve Cornwell (1956-2022), President of IAFOR (2016-2022)","link":"https://iafor.org/obituary-professor-steve-cornwell/","date":1651031596000,"content":"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Obituary-Steve-Cornwell-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"Obituary: Professor Steve Cornwell (1956-2022), President of IAFOR (2016-2022)\" srcset=\"https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Obituary-Steve-Cornwell-150x150.jpg 150w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Obituary-Steve-Cornwell-600x600.jpg 600w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Obituary-Steve-Cornwell-100x100.jpg 100w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Obituary-Steve-Cornwell-50x50.jpg 50w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Obituary-Steve-Cornwell-300x300.jpg 300w, https://iafor.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Obituary-Steve-Cornwell-32x32.jpg 32w\" />Professor Steve Cornwell (1956-2022) President of IAFOR (2016-2022) It is with great sadness that we write of the passing of the President of IAFOR, Professor Steve Cornwell, who died of cancer earlier this week in Osaka, Japan. He was Chairman of the International Academic Advisory Board, and a member of the Board of Directors. He <a href=\"https://iafor.org/obituary-professor-steve-cornwell/\">...</a>\n<p><a href=\"https://iafor.org/obituary-professor-steve-cornwell/\">Source</a></p>","author":"IAFOR","siteTitle":"The International Academic Forum (IAFOR)","siteHash":"db6175d8277e1d8dd86d5cc607b1dd9335cce255aa7e00b46d0931f23a0d47f6","entryHash":"10c67f403b3b8c9ea4ef09102a3e2dedcaad4f6248eb2ad289f9136b9a656f64","category":"Interdisciplinary"}